WEBVTT

00:00:00.517 --> 00:00:02.177
At the end of the week, take a

00:00:02.177 --> 00:00:03.737
few minutes to look back at what you

00:00:03.737 --> 00:00:06.077
finished and decide what to do with anything

00:00:06.077 --> 00:00:06.637
unfinished.

00:00:07.877 --> 00:00:09.297
If you still need to choose a trail

00:00:09.297 --> 00:00:11.617
for the family walk, you can carry that

00:00:11.617 --> 00:00:12.797
task into next week.

00:00:13.609 --> 00:00:15.749
If researching a new tent can wait, save

00:00:15.749 --> 00:00:16.229
it in Someday.

00:00:17.389 --> 00:00:18.869
And if you’ve decided to keep an item

00:00:18.869 --> 00:00:20.649
you purchased, you can let go of the

00:00:20.649 --> 00:00:21.709
task to return it.

00:00:22.889 --> 00:00:26.009
Unfinished tasks don’t automatically become next week’s commitments.

00:00:27.069 --> 00:00:28.889
You choose what still deserves your time.
